156	     * structured form. A non-blank {@code addressLine1} (with an optional {@code addressLine2})
157	     * wins over the flat {@code address}; either form satisfies the address requirement. The
158	     * stored/returned {@code address} is the composed value: the normalized {@code addressLine1},
159	     * plus a single space and the normalized {@code addressLine2} when present, falling back to the
160	     * normalized flat {@code address}. An owner supplying neither is a required-field 400.
161	     */
